     "\r\n\r\n<font face=\"georgia\" size=\"2\"><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\">Dear all,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\">We are excited to announce the <strong>2nd edition</strong> of our course: <strong>Design, Implement and Promote Species Monitoring in R</strong>, taking place <strong>12–14 October </strong>, fully online to foster international participation.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\">This\r\n course covers both theory and practice of long-term monitoring \r\nprotocols, including Census, Capture-Mark-Recapture, distance sampling, \r\nsite occupancy, and N-mixture methods. Participants will learn to design\r\n robust field protocols and analyze data in R using provided scripts.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\">Daily sessions from 09:00–12:30 (Berlin time), combining live lectures and self-guided practicals.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\">Course website: <a href=\"https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/species-monitoring-in-r/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" title=\"This external link will open in a new window\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/species-monitoring-in-r/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792471442663000&amp;usg=AOvVaw34mu5ObJt3G8NY1DW6ybCO\">https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/species-monitoring-in-r/</a> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\">Best regards,<br> Carlo</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia;font-size:small\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia;font-size:small\"></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:trebuchet ms;font-size:10pt\">--------------------<br><br>Carlo Pecoraro, Ph.D<br><br><br>Physalia-courses DIRECTOR<br><br><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">in...@physalia-courses.org</a><br><br>mobile: <a href=\"tel:+49%20176%2045230846\" value=\"+4917645230846\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+49 17645230846</a><br><br><a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/physaliacourses.bsky.social\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" title=\"This external link will open in a new window\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://bsky.app/profile/physaliacourses.bsky.social&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792471442663000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1xeu4Qe-bqBrpZmKxfoyu8\">Bluesky</a> <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/physalia-courses-a64418127/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" title=\"This external link will open in a new window\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.linkedin.com/in/physalia-courses-a64418127/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792471442663000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0tEJFPCZje3P6omtn-a8Ax\">Linkedin</a><br></p></font>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<br>"
